   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>The table gives predictions of the average costs of a gasoline car after the year 2030.</p>\n<p>Which graph best represents the relationship between time and the predicted cost?</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <caption>\n  Gasoline car\n  </caption>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\"> Time (years) </th>\n      <th scope=\"col\"> Cost (thousand of dollars) </th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td> 0 </td>\n      <td> 35 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td> 5 </td>\n      <td> 40.2 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td> 10 </td>\n      <td> 46.3 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td> 15 </td>\n      <td> 53.2 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td> 20 </td>\n      <td> 61.2 </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
